* Task 2 fixture: SELECT SINGLE statement
* Demonstrates FR-19 requirement: SELECT SINGLE...FROM reads DDM once
* See also: fixture 11-sql-select-single.nsp in parser tests
* Expected: one EdgeReads entry for EMPLOYEES (the FROM table operand)
* and zero edges for column names or INTO targets

DEFINE DATA LOCAL
  1 #EMP-NAME (A30)
  1 #DEPT-ID (N3)
END-DEFINE

SELECT SINGLE COL1 INTO #EMP-NAME FROM EMPLOYEES WHERE DEPT = :#DEPT-ID

END
